\begin{itemize}
\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath, record 30005928 (OWR-14298373-006). Catalogue curation under CC BY 4.0; definitions and English exposition added locally.
\url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Statistical Physics and Random Surfaces (2024), Oberwolfach Reports, DOI 10.4171/owr/2024/25, pp. 1387--1444. Original report and mathematical context. Incorporated report material remains under the source CC BY-SA 4.0 terms unless otherwise noted.
\url{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2024/25}.
\end{itemize}
\label{end:30005928}

